# 21st.dev Component Marketplace & MCP

When building UI sections:
1. Always check for ready-made components using the `21st` MCP server tools: `search` and `get_component`.
2. Adapt returned code to match the local design system, tailwind tokens, and `cn()` utility.
3. Replace all mock/placeholder assets with functional SVGs and crisp vector icons.
